# Electricity Consumption Analyzer

## About
This is my first Python project. It calculates household electricity consumption and estimates electricity costs.

## Features
- Calculates daily electricity consumption
- Estimates monthly electricity usage
- Calculates estimated electricity costs
- Compares electricity usage of different appliances
- Displays a bar chart
- Exports data to CSV

## Technology Used
- Python
- Google Colab
- Pandas
- Matplotlib

## Formula
Energy (kWh) = Power (W) × Usage Hours / 1000

## Note
The monthly consumption is estimated using 30 days. The electricity rate used in this project is an example, not an official tariff.

